pack.name=Air Strong Legs Parkour v2.1.1 BP
pack.description=It's not enough for Steve to carry 44,000 tons in his pockets and smelt things at 3,000°C... now he has decided to defy gravity. He can compress the air in his legs to jump and glide like a torpedo in the water. With these compression exercises, he has built up so much strength that he can now vault over fences, tear through the air with a quick forward or backward dash, and hang onto walls!\n\n-= © Created by ThaguchoBisteca =-
